@startuml 5-state-machine
!include _style.iuml
title EduFlow — State Machine Diagram: Assignment submission

state "Not submitted" as NotSubmitted
state "Missing" as Missing : deadline passed,\nno submission
state Submitted : files can still\nbe replaced
state "Under review" as UnderReview : files locked
state Graded : marks + feedback
state Returned : needs changes
state Resubmitted : attempt + 1

[*] --> NotSubmitted : assignment published

NotSubmitted --> Submitted : upload work\n[before deadline]
NotSubmitted --> Missing : deadline passes
Missing --> Submitted : upload work\n[late allowed] / mark late

Submitted --> UnderReview : teacher opens
Submitted --> Graded : teacher grades
UnderReview --> Graded : teacher grades
UnderReview --> Returned : teacher returns\n/ add comments

Returned --> Resubmitted : student uploads again
Resubmitted --> UnderReview : teacher opens
Resubmitted --> Graded : teacher grades

Graded --> Returned : student requests\nresubmission [allowed]
Graded --> [*] : assignment closed
@enduml
